WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.240
I'm about the size of a grapefruit, and someone famous made fun of me for it.

2
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.490
But I was the first satellite to run on sunlight, and I'm still up here.

3
00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.020
Every satellite launched since has flown beneath me.

4
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:27.010
My radio went quiet in 1964, but I keep going round and round.

5
00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:32.310
I was the size of a grapefruit. I'm still here.
